WEBVTT

00:10:26.833 --> 00:10:31.101
hadn't died of some terrible,
long, drawn-out illness.

00:10:31.125 --> 00:10:33.309
She died suddenly, instantly,

00:10:33.333 --> 00:10:37.059
sparing us and her that pain.

00:10:37.083 --> 00:10:40.601
We had a huge amount of social support
from family and friends

00:10:40.625 --> 00:10:42.393
to help us through.

00:10:42.417 --> 00:10:43.851
And most of all,

00:10:43.875 --> 00:10:47.268
we still had two beautiful
boys to live for,

00:10:47.292 --> 00:10:48.976
who needed us now,

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:54.875
and deserved to have as normal a life
as we could possibly give them.

00:10:56.333 --> 00:10:59.143
Being able to switch the focus
of your attention

00:10:59.167 --> 00:11:01.101
to also include the good